WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:01.400
Here's what done looks like.

2
00:00:01.400 --> 00:00:03.254
The change record is approved,

3
00:00:03.254 --> 00:00:06.887
the settings file holds no
secret, and the preflight said go.

4
00:00:06.887 --> 00:00:11.367
In test, the pilot policy covered two
apps, and the old secret and legacy

5
00:00:11.367 --> 00:00:16.001
account were kept through the parallel
run, then disabled, never deleted.

6
00:00:16.001 --> 00:00:19.538
The group managed account came
through Chapter 6's plan,

7
00:00:19.538 --> 00:00:22.537
and every workload policy
started report-only.

8
00:00:22.537 --> 00:00:25.838
The smoke test passed, and
the rollback was rehearsed.

9
00:00:25.838 --> 00:00:29.780
Every criterion was signed,
production rings went one at a time,

10
00:00:29.780 --> 00:00:33.940
the first week's drift was clean,
and every evidence folder checks.
